msgctxt "140"
msgid "Are you finished, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Not quite yet, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Don't apologize. Just let me know when you're done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Yeah, I've done all I need to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Right... I guess you'll be leaving, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Yup, heading down to Okinawa tomorrow morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"You know, I never pegged you as the kind of guy to start\r\n"
"an orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"It's been a dream of mine to take care of kids, though.\r\n"
"Just like Kazama-san did for me when I had nowhere to turn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"A textbook Kazuma Kiryu response if I've ever heard one. But why Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "There's a place there with ties to Sunflower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"When their old manager died, they asked me if I knew anyone\r\n"
"who might be able to lend a hand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "And you decided that person should be you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"It seemed like the perfect opportunity. Aren't many\r\n"
"opportunities for an ex-yakuza out in the wild, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "I hear Okinawa's beautiful, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Yeah, and the orphanage is right down by the beach.\r\n"
"You should come visit when you get the chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "I'd love that... but I doubt I'll be able to for a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Well... I'm actually leaving the country. Tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Where to?"
msgstr "Verso dove?"

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"The U.S. They're starting a training program for a new\r\n"
"branch of the Metropolitan Police, and they've asked me\r\n"
"to be an instructor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "...Is it really that simple?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"You'd probably try to stop me if I said more.\r\n"
"Might be best to just leave it at that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"...Right. Well, I can't say I'm not happy for you.\r\n"
"It's good to see you following your heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"I thought you'd say that. And besides, I don't think you'd\r\n"
"like it very much if I turned them down to stay with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Heh, guess not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"There's still a lot I want to accomplish as a police officer,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san. Career goals, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "And... I think America's the best place for me to do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "You're probably right."
msgstr "Probabilmente hai ragione."

msgctxt "488"
msgid "So let's... go our separate ways. For now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"I'll come find you once I've done what I need to do, okay?\r\n"
"Promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "...It's a promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Done already? I thought you'd want to spend some more time\r\n"
"paying your respects to the people you've lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Good point. It might be nice to stop for a second and reflect\r\n"
"on everything that's happened..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"We can get to that later, though. I assume you'd like to pay\r\n"
"your respects to the people you've lost first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it might be nice to stop for a second and reflect on\r\n"
"everything that's happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Not quite yet."
msgstr "Non ancora."

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Yeah, I've done all I need to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7376"
msgid "Sayama"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7380"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7384"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7388"
msgid "Talk_No"
msgstr ""
